{"lines":[{"w":0.016460905075073237,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.10082304530196955,"y":0.156976743984655,"t":"E"},{"x":0.10082304510326412,"w":0.014403292338053389,"y":0.38372093000599272,"h":0.013081395583944833,"t":"F","c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"y":0.046511627815394085,"x":0.7716049391467531,"t":"1718867188","w":0.069958845774332645},{"c":1,"t":"Many such stadiums are situated in suburban areas, designed for sporting use only and","h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.68930043538411456,"y":0.097383720797162066,"x":0.14609052295866293},{"w":0.7016460673014322,"c":1,"t":"surrounded by parking lots. These factors mean that they may not be as accessible to the","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.14609054650177739,"y":0.11482558126234299},{"c":1,"y":0.1322143695825817,"w":0.57407409667968756,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"general public, require more energy to run and contribute to urban heat.","x":0.14609052357807742},{"h":0.014562276002234698,"y":0.15694935203329274,"t":"But many of today's most innovative architects see scope for the stadium to help improve the","c":1,"x":0.14403292767231221,"w":0.73868311564127598},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.14609052541828599,"t":"city. Among the current strategies, two seem to be having particular success: the stadium as","y":0.17285041237740217,"c":1,"w":0.72839508056640634},{"t":"an urban hub, and as a power plant.","x":0.14609053414782844,"w":0.28189300537109374,"h":0.01454001966999896,"y":0.19040697659873929,"c":1},{"t":"There's a growing trend for stadiums to be equipped with public spaces and services that","y":0.21482766345010162,"w":0.70997472127278649,"h":0.017588586211906621,"c":1,"x":0.14398993633456694},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"serve a function beyond sport, such as hotels, retail outlets, conference centres, restaurants","x":0.14403292136079984,"w":0.72427983601888024,"y":0.23255813940098002},{"x":0.14396537300016679,"w":0.73676106770833349,"h":0.019223075030970538,"t":"and bars, children's playgrounds and green space. Creating mixed-use developments such as","y":0.24696740999552858,"c":1},{"h":0.014723203769140047,"y":0.26590106021206283,"t":"this reinforces compactness and multi-functionality, making more efficient use of land and","x":0.14609054367796784,"c":1,"w":0.72016459147135425},{"y":0.28343023243377263,"c":1,"x":0.14609052965107983,"t":"helping to regenerate urban spaces.","w":0.28395062764485679,"h":0.01309509131315878},{"t":"This opens the space up to families and a wider cross-section of society, instead of catering","h":0.016195524146054074,"y":0.30800942278270393,"x":0.14403291228850434,"c":1,"w":0.72839508056640623},{"t":"only to sportspeople and supporters. There have been many examples of this in the UK: the","c":1,"y":0.32412790683019177,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.14403291231323825,"w":0.72839508056640623},{"c":1,"y":0.34156976729568544,"w":0.72016459147135414,"t":"mixed-use facilities at Wembley and Old Trafford have become a blueprint for many other","x":0.14403293050210589,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"t":"stadiums in the world.","c":1,"y":0.35683214864368407,"x":0.14388238370579831,"w":0.18145701090494792,"h":0.015367213632248911},{"t":"The phenomenon of stadiums as power stations has arisen from the idea that energy","c":1,"h":0.016022611984235047,"w":0.66872426350911451,"x":0.14403292985076196,"y":0.38368669048206239},{"x":0.14403292772248619,"y":0.39958775026501003,"w":0.73868311564127598,"h":0.016195524146054296,"c":1,"t":"problems can be overcome by integrating interconnected buildings by means of a smart grid,"},{"x":0.14403292766916062,"y":0.41715116265789343,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.73868311564127598,"t":"which is an electricity supply network that uses digital communications technology to detect"},{"w":0.70802032470703113,"t":"and react to local changes in usage, without significant energy losses. Stadiums are ideal","h":0.019757613416835795,"x":0.14394310249429415,"y":0.43192571294700688,"c":1},{"h":0.014723203769140047,"y":0.45053003552951765,"c":1,"x":0.14403291322952791,"t":"for these purposes, because their canopies have a large surface area for fitting photovoltaic","w":0.72222223917643213},{"y":0.46643109531202276,"w":0.69958847045898442,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140047,"x":0.1460905383079564,"t":"panels and rise high enough (more than 40 metres) to make use of micro wind turbines."},{"t":"Freiburg Mage Solar Stadium in Germany is the first of a new wave of stadiums as power","y":0.49116607761834108,"w":0.71399175008138016,"h":0.016195524146054074,"x":0.14403293125217687,"c":1},{"t":"plants, which also includes the Amsterdam Arena and the Kaohsiung Stadium. The latter,","y":0.50872093008385355,"h":0.016014052504504606,"c":1,"x":0.14403293141232135,"w":0.71399175008138027},{"x":0.14403292861302616,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"inaugurated in 2009, has 8,844 photovoltaic panels producing up to 1.14 GWh of electricity","y":0.52470930216634426,"w":0.73251027425130211,"c":1},{"t":"annually. This reduces the annual output of carbon dioxide by 660 tons and supplies up","y":0.54210836284190311,"x":0.14403293104162637,"w":0.69341562906901044,"h":0.016031171463965155,"c":1},{"y":0.55948174314665733,"w":0.70576131184895829,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"to 80 percent of the surrounding area when the stadium is not in use. This is proof that a","x":0.14197531104985273},{"h":0.015996932421752708,"y":0.57558139520282292,"t":"stadium can serve its city, and have a decidedly positive impact in terms of reduction of CO2","c":1,"x":0.1440329276752948,"w":0.73868311564127609},{"c":1,"t":"emissions.","x":0.14609053436602343,"y":0.59302325566473857,"w":0.086419754028320306,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.61773255800617721,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"w":0.70987655639648439,"t":"Sporting arenas have always been central to the life and culture of cities. In every era, the","x":0.14609052826771016},{"t":"stadium has acquired new value and uses: from military fortress to residential village, public","x":0.14403292767558867,"y":0.63515901083348347,"h":0.016003780005537038,"c":1,"w":0.73868311564127609},{"c":1,"y":0.64958775026397275,"w":0.69135803222656245,"x":0.1440329180138635,"t":"space to theatre and most recently a field for experimentation in advanced engineering.","h":0.016195524146054185},{"c":1,"h":0.017477812840042684,"y":0.66715116263042862,"t":"The stadium of today now brings together multiple functions, thus helping cities to create a","x":0.14403291229089604,"w":0.72839508056640612},{"x":0.14589721312296924,"w":0.14862393697102869,"h":0.014326202293728496,"c":1,"y":0.68344048078071395,"t":"sustainable future."},{"t":"21","c":1,"x":0.85802469125562064,"w":0.022633744875590001,"y":0.86773255795657411,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","c":1,"x":0.66991094639740412,"w":0.30613845825195307,"y":0.95311055968589831,"h":0.033792529426278195}],"w":2400,"h":3395}